	(text "36 V from the S-350-36 PSU. Mains AC never comes onto this board.\nQ1 = reverse-polarity protection (P-FET, gate clamped by D1). D2 = bus TVS.\nU1 LM5164: 36 V -> 5 V, ~300 kHz (R_RON 41.2k), 47 uH, type-3 ripple injection (RA/CA/CB)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
